{
  "name": "Validate phone numbers in Google Sheets with 1Lookup",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "0e6d3457-5b71-4853-84f6-9403c8fff438",
      "name": "Template overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -620,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 540,
        "height": 1003,
        "content": "## Validate phone numbers in Google Sheets with 1Lookup\n\n![Validate phone numbers in Google Sheets with 1Lookup](https://www.1lookup.io/images/integrations/n8n-templates/sheets-phone-validation.png)\n\n## Who it's for\nSales and marketing teams who keep leads in Google Sheets and lose time calling dead, wrong or landline numbers.\n\n## How it works\n1. Every hour, the workflow reads your lead sheet.\n2. It skips rows that have no phone number or were already checked.\n3. The 1Lookup node validates each number: active or not, line type (mobile, landline or VoIP), Do Not Call listing, and a recommended action (APPROVE, REVIEW or BLOCK).\n4. The results go back into the same row, so you can sort and filter the sheet by them.\n\n## How to set up\n1. Start a 7-day free trial at [app.1lookup.io](https://app.1lookup.io/signup?utm_source=n8n&utm_medium=template&utm_campaign=sheets-phone-validation), then copy your API key from the **API Keys** page.\n2. In n8n, add a **1Lookup API** credential with that key. The 1Lookup node is verified by n8n: on n8n Cloud, search for 1Lookup in the nodes panel. On a self-hosted instance, install `@momentum-labs/n8n-nodes-1lookup` once from **Settings > Community Nodes**.\n3. Add these column headers to your sheet: `phone_status`, `line_type`, `dnc_listed`, `action`, `checked_at`.\n4. Open both Google Sheets nodes and pick your spreadsheet and tab.\n5. In **Settings**, type the name of your phone column (default `Phone`).\n\n## Requirements\n- A 1Lookup API key (the 7-day free trial includes one)\n- A Google account with access to the sheet\n\n## How to customize\n- Swap the Schedule Trigger for a Google Sheets Trigger to check rows as soon as they are added.\n- Add a Filter after **Validate phone number** to send only mobile numbers to your SMS tool."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "2c73a1eb-0fd1-4d63-9655-cfb99bd74473",
      "name": "Step 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -40,
        -200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 860,
        "height": 380,
        "content": "## 1. Read the rows that still need a check\nRuns every hour. **Settings** holds the name of your phone column. Rows without a phone, or with a `phone_status` already filled in, are skipped."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "10b16c63-9705-48ae-b875-3babf4050811",
      "name": "Step 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        860,
        -200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 300,
        "height": 380,
        "content": "## 2. Check the number\nOne 1Lookup credit per number. A bad number is marked ERROR instead of stopping the run."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "6d957a46-d827-4a56-afb2-d56becc6e132",
      "name": "Step 3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1180,
        -200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 480,
        "height": 380,
        "content": "## 3. Write the result back\nMatches on the row number, so nothing else in the sheet changes."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
